{
  "$comment": [
    "Metadata of the editable site texts (shared/messages/<locale>.json) that the JSON cannot say itself:",
    "sections = the admin sections (top-level namespaces) in display order; texts = per-key overrides:",
    "kind (richtext: paragraphs separated by an empty line; template: filled in by a public CLIENT component",
    "without an ICU runtime — only plain {placeholders} and the default tags; link: a site link) and required",
    "(never saved empty in the default locale: headings, buttons, links, the only accessible name of a control,",
    "the lead form states and errors, the owner notifications); a key without an entry is optional and its kind",
    "is detected (icu when a default has ICU syntax, else text); images = the landing images (content_images",
    "rows, not messages) and the section they are edited with. Read by the backend (core/site-texts,",
    "admin validation and the seed) and by the frontend (landing image slots; tests of what the site renders)."
  ],
